[v8 152.2.0] 
[v8 152.2.0]     Rust is available in the Chromium build but 3p repos that use //build may
[v8 152.2.0]     not use Rust and thus won't want to depend on having the Rust toolchain
[v8 152.2.0]     present, so this defaults to off in those cases.
