[v8 152.2.0]     corresponding buildflag to determine whether to interact with PA
[v8 152.2.0]     source at all (pulling the component in via GN, including headers,
[v8 152.2.0]     etc.). There is nothing stopping a lazy embedder from ignoring this
[v8 152.2.0]     and unconditionally using PA, but such a setup is inadvisable.
